    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Wind-damaged roof repair in Utah requires immediate action\u2014especially after heavy canyon gusts common along the Wasatch Front and mountain areas\u2014to prevent water leaks before the next storm.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "requires immediate action"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Immediate Steps After Wind Damage"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Check safely from the ground: Take photos of any visible debris, loose material, or missing pieces. Do not climb onto a damaged or high-slope roof yourself."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Stop active leaks: Call a local pro for emergency tarping if water is entering your attic or living space."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Schedule a professional inspection: Request a thorough check of your ridges, rakes, corners, and flashing where high-wind uplift strikes first."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Contact your insurance: Report the storm loss and provide the photo documentation and written assessment supplied by your licensed roofing contractor."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Common Types of Wind Damage in Utah"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Lifted or torn shingles: High wind breaks shingle seals, peeling tabs back and leaving the underlayment open to rain."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Flashing failures: Strong gusts wiggle metal flashing loose around chimneys, vents, and roof valleys."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Debris punctures: Flying tree branches crack tiles and dent metal vents or gutters."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like help, please tell me:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "What city or area in Utah you are located in"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "If you have an active water leak right now"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Whether you plan to file an insurance claim"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help guide you on local emergency response options or what to look for in a contractor estimate."
